WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:05.030 align:start position:0%
 
caleb dunn  served as a combat medic specialist in  the us army before becoming an emergency  medical technician  in new york city tales of his combat  record and solid reputation  meant that he was eventually picked up  by the shd and it wasn't long before he  was recruited  months after the outbreak that brought  down new york city dunn  and fellow agent and friend kaminsky  have been activated  and are investigating a potential  resurgence among the previously  dismantled last man battalion  the lmb leader charles bliss is dead and  the surviving forces have been scattered  by the division and jtf  however months later reports were  beginning to show an increase of l b  activity  it seemed as if they were starting to  rebuild and one of the largest concerns  was the noticeable increase in weapons  and technology they suddenly had at  their disposal  so agents dun and kaminsky made it their  mission to find and put a stop to this  new supply  their initial intel suggests that it's  kinah but he has since fallen out with  the lmb  after abandoning them during an attack  by the division and has since left the  city long ago  regardless they've been given some  information on a warehouse that is of  particular interest to the lmb  and this could be potentially where  they're storing the weapons or better  yet where their unknown supplier is  hiding out  with a backup of jtf support they plan  an assault on the heavily guarded  warehouse  sweeping through the building dunn  focuses on clearing the lower levels  while kaminsky secures the upper floors  rapidly eliminating lmb  troops before they have time to react  dunn receives a call over his earpiece  from kaminsky  primary target located dunn confirms  and immediately starts making his way to  his location but before he is able to  catch up  there is a commotion and the comms cut  out  breaking a window done quickly and  carefully peers into an office  there before him he finds kaminsky  standing in the middle of the room  with a woman dressed in black holding a  knife to his throat  as dunn attempts to talk her down she  begins slowly backing out of the room  towards the door  all while keeping the knife pressed up  closely against kaminsky's throat  then just before she exits through the  door she swiftly thrusts the blade  straight into kaminsky's neck  and then once again into his lower back  with her immobilized  she takes off quickly down the hallway  dunn opens fire but it's too late  she has already managed to slip away he  promptly drops to the ground  and tries to tend to his friend's wounds  but ultimately he begins to realize  there is nothing he can do  he gathers himself together and sits  quietly with kaminsky staying with him  as he succumbs to his mortal wounds  and draws his last breath  dunn goes to visit an informant who has  loose ties to the lmb  hoping that he may have some information  about the identity of this woman  he began to realize during their  altercation that she wasn't just another  street thug trying to take advantage of  the situation  she was fast well-trained and knew  exactly what she was doing  arriving at the apartment building dunn  finds the informant  his throat has been slit and he's been  left to bleed out on the chair  using isaac's technology he was able to  recreate the events of what had happened  it was the same woman she had gotten to  the informant first  looking closely at the echo projection  he tried to find anything that could  hint at her identity  but her face doesn't match anything in  the database so she can't be a rogue shd  agent  but given the state of the country if  she isn't an agent  what is she then suddenly isaac pipes up  listing off a number of trace chemicals  that have been found at the scene  copper sulfate chlorine dioxide  polydimethylsiloxane  these are all substances that are used  in water treatment  contacting feylau through the comms dun  asks for the location of the nearest  water treatment facility  he knows it's a long shot but it's all  he has at this stage  staying at the treatment plant for over  three hours dunn hopes to find something  anything after some time has passed  again  isaac beeps it has just registered some  sort of transmission  searching dunn eventually finds a  military-grade fiber-optic cable  and as he begins to follow the line to  see where it's coming from isaac alerts  him again to some movement nearby  swiftly ducking for cover behind some  hedges he lays motionless just off to  the side of the main path  two figures are approaching it was her  and she was with an agent  isaac scanned his identity agent ike  ronson  he must be rogue thought done but for  some reason his watch was still orange  rather than confronting them then and  there dunn decides to remain hidden  instead he wants to first find out where  the cable leads to and secondly who this  person really is  he did hear her talking about the lmb  and she has an agent working with her  and possibly others there is most  definitely something bigger going on  here  his search of the cable eventually leads  him down a manhole and into the  underground service tunnels  there dunn finds a room and by gaining  access to the door control panel he  accidentally sets off an alarm protocol  figuring he should have at least a few  minutes before the unknown woman returns  he decides to proceed onwards and  swiftly enters  his suspicions are correct she is very  obviously well connected and a part of  something much bigger at play  there are maps of manhattan the eastern  coast and there are photos of division  agents all over the walls  the map information points towards some  sort of large-scale operation  focusing on new york and philadelphia  on top of the desk there are division  watches once owned by shd agents  dunn could only imagine what had  happened to them but he wasn't able to  think about this for long  bursting into the room and firing a  vector the woman had returned  rapidly returning fire done advanced  towards her position  and promptly knocked the weapon out of  her hand in that same motion  she grabbed hold of his arm and using  his own momentum threw him over his  shoulder  causing him to come crashing down on top  of the desk while he lay on the ground  quickly trying to regain his feet she  unsheathed her knife and moved to stand  threateningly above him  dunn immediately swung his legs around  taking her feet out from underneath her  they both hurriedly rose to their feet  blocking eyes they stared at each other  face to face  when suddenly she let out a victorious  smile and bolted from the room  unable to pursue her due to a bullet  that had struck his leg during the fight  and puzzled by her unusual behavior  dunn's eyes rapidly darted around the  room  he located a monitor with a countdown  timer on it  in 11 seconds something was going to  happen and based on her reaction  he more than likely didn't want to be  there when it did  moving as fast as he could he made his  way quickly out of the room up through  the tunnels  and back to the surface he knew he had  to gain as much distance as possible  from the timer  so he continued to run as far as he  could when suddenly from behind him  the compound exploded launching him into  the air  surrounded by burning debris he is  located and helped to his feet by some  jtf officers who'd been sent by fey  to check up on him  back in the shd base of operations dunn  has been patched up by medical staff  his isaac was completely destroyed by  the blast and nothing he witnessed has  been able to be extracted from it  but he knew what he'd seen lists and  photos of agents  safe houses operational plans she  they knew everything about the shd  he discussed with faye his plans to make  his way to philadelphia  the one other city that was clearly  marked out on the map  although the passing of time is helping  to heal the loss of his friend  he plans to find out what this woman was  up to and when the time is right  avengers death  there may not be a lot happening in the  division universe while we wait for news  on all of these new updates  games and books i've been talking about  but i'm not in the mood to take a break  and put the channel on hold just yet  and there isn't really any other games  that interest me right now so i'm using  this opportunity to catch up on a number  of subjects that i never got around to  at the time  and the extremist malice series is one  that is well overdue  if you weren't aware this is based on  the series of three division comic books  that came out at the start of the  division 2. you can find these on  darkhorse.com  anyway thank you very much for watching  and i'll catch you in the next one  [Music]  cheers  [Applause]  [Music]

